{
    "name": "升級",
    "icon": "productivebees:upgrade_base",
    "category": "productivebees:items",
    "pages": [
        {
            "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
            "item": "productivebees:upgrade_base",
            "text": "升級可以放入機器和蜂箱中，以增加它們的功能或提高性能。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:crafting",
            "recipe": "productivebees:upgrades/base",
            "text": "所有其他升級的基礎。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:crafting",
            "recipe": "productivebees:upgrades/breeding",
            "text": "可用於：$(l:hives/advanced_hives#expanded)擴展蜂箱$(/l)，$(l:blocks/catcher)捕蜂機$(/l)。",
            "anchor": "babee"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "text": "安裝在蜂箱後，幼蜂升級會使居住在蜂箱內的蜜蜂有小機率在沒有你的介入下繁殖並產生新的後代。請注意，無法正常繁殖的蜜蜂無法使用此升級。$(br)安裝在$(l:blocks/catcher)捕蜂機$(/l) 後，只會捕捉幼蜂並放入蜜蜂籠。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:crafting",
            "recipe": "productivebees:upgrades/productivity",
            "text": "可用於：$(l:hives/advanced_hives#expanded)擴展蜂箱$(/l)，$(l:blocks/honey_generator)蜂蜜發電機$(/l)。",
            "anchor": "productivity"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "text": "安裝在蜂箱後，產率升級會增加蜜蜂每次旅程生產的蜂巢數量。可以安裝多個產率升級。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:crafting",
            "recipe": "productivebees:upgrades/time",
            "text": "可用於：$(l:hives/advanced_hives#expanded)擴展蜂箱$(/l)，$(l:blocks/centrifuge)離心機$(/l)，$(l:blocks/incubator)幼蜂孵化器$(/l)，$(l:blocks/honey_generator)蜂蜜發電機$(/l)。",
            "anchor": "speed"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "text": "安裝在蜂箱後，速度升級會減少蜜蜂在蜂箱內停留的時間。$(br)安裝在$(l:blocks/centrifuge)離心機$(/l)或$(l:blocks/incubator)幼蜂孵化器$(/l) 後，它會提高運行速度。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:crafting",
            "recipe": "productivebees:upgrades/filter",
            "text": "可用於：$(l:hives/advanced_hives#expanded)擴展蜂箱$(/l)，$(l:blocks/catcher)捕蜂機$(/l)。",
            "anchor": "filter"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "text": "右鍵點擊蜜蜂將其加入篩選。將篩選放入合成格清除內容。安裝在蜂箱後，只有篩選上指定的蜜蜂才允許進入。$(br)安裝在捕蜂機後，只會捕捉篩選指定的蜜蜂。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:crafting",
            "recipe": "productivebees:upgrades/range",
            "text": "可用於：$(l:hives/advanced_hives#expanded)擴展蜂箱$(/l)，$(l:blocks/catcher)捕蜂機$(/l)。",
            "anchor": "range"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "text": "安裝在蜂箱後，農場和收集器/囤積者蜜蜂的作業範圍會每次升級增加 1 格，預設為 4 格。安裝在捕蜂機後，範圍升級會在所有方向擴大 1 格作業範圍。可以安裝多個範圍升級。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:crafting",
            "recipe": "productivebees:upgrades/anti_teleport",
            "text": "可用於：$(l:hives/advanced_hives#expanded)擴展蜂箱$(/l)。",
            "anchor": "anti_teleport"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "text": "安裝在蜂箱後，能夠傳送的蜜蜂在裝有此升級的蜂箱中將不再傳送。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:crafting",
            "recipe": "productivebees:upgrades/bee_sampler",
            "text": "可用於：$(l:hives/advanced_hives#expanded)擴展蜂箱$(/l)。",
            "anchor": "sampler"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "text": "安裝在蜂箱後，每次拜訪都會提取少量授粉蜜蜂的樣本。完全不會傷害牠們。可以在同一個蜂箱中安裝多個以提高速率。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:crafting",
            "recipe": "productivebees:upgrades/comb_block",
            "text": "可用於：$(l:hives/advanced_hives#expanded)擴展蜂箱$(/l)。",
            "anchor": "comb_block"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "text": "安裝在蜂箱後，蜜蜂將生產完整的蜂巢塊而非蜂巢。"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:crafting",
            "recipe": "productivebees:upgrades/simulator",
            "text": "可用於：$(l:hives/advanced_hives#expanded)擴展蜂箱$(/l)。",
            "anchor": "simulator"
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "text": "安裝在蜂箱後，蜜蜂將不再離開蜂箱，牠們的採花飛行將被模擬以提高伺服器性能。蜜蜂的花朵方塊或帶有花朵方塊的餵食板必須放置在蜂箱的底部，不要擋住正面，而是在其正下方。"
        },
